{"id":51697,"date":"2026-06-18T23:14:38","date_gmt":"2026-06-18T22:14:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/hybrid-day-ba11-beja\/"},"modified":"2026-09-23T15:11:34","modified_gmt":"2026-09-23T14:11:34","slug":"hybrid-day-ba11-beja","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/hybrid-day-ba11-beja\/","title":{"rendered":"Hybrid Day BA11 Beja 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Hybrid Day BA11 Beja 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Hybrid Day BA11 Beja 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>26 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, num cen\u00e1rio \u00edmpar e de enorme simbolismo: as instala\u00e7\u00f5es da hist\u00f3rica <strong>Base A\u00e9rea N\u00ba 11<\/strong>, em <strong>Beja<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o do Alentejo. Integrando a prestigiada Iberian League da modalidade de fitness racing, o evento desafia os atletas a testar os seus limites f\u00edsicos e mentais num formato exigente que funde corrida cont\u00ednua com esta\u00e7\u00f5es de treino funcional de alta intensidade.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o cumpre o formato padronizado de <strong>8 km de corrida intervalados por 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais<\/strong> (SkiErg, Sled Push, Sled Pull, Burpee Broad Jumps, Rowing, Farmers Carry, Sandbag Lunges e Wall Balls), com divis\u00f5es adaptadas para <strong>Singles (Open e Pro)<\/strong>, <strong>Doubles (Masculinos, Femininos e Mistos)<\/strong> e <strong>Relay de Estafetas<\/strong> (equipas de 4 elementos). Toda a prova conta com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, ju\u00edzes oficiais de standard em cada esta\u00e7\u00e3o e medalha de finalista entregue na meta.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Hybrid Day League<\/strong>, em estreita coopera\u00e7\u00e3o com a For\u00e7a A\u00e9rea Portuguesa e o Munic\u00edpio de Beja, oferecendo uma experi\u00eancia desportiva segura e memor\u00e1vel em pista militar.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong cl